  "statement": "Replace each of the `n` integers by its **rank among the distinct values**: the smallest distinct value gets `0`, the next smaller gets `1`, and so on. Equal values get equal ranks.\n\n**Input.** First line `n`. Second line the `n` integers.\n\n**Output.** One line with the `n` ranks separated by spaces.\n\n**Example.**\n\nInput:\n```\n6\n40 10 40 -5 10 99\n```\nOutput:\n```\n2 1 2 0 1 3\n```",
  "constraints": [
    "1 ≤ n ≤ 1000 in this browser version (the idea scales to 2·10^5)",
    "−10^9 ≤ a_i ≤ 10^9"
  ],
  "timeLimitMs": 1000,
